    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Galls used in Leather Tanning, Tawing & Currying: McCulloch (1880), Dictionary of Commerce, scan p. 48"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Its principal use, however, is in the manufacture of sulphuric acid. Tannic Acid or Gallo-tannic Acid.—Tanning principle is contained in gall nuts of the Quercus infectoria, sumach, &c."@en ;
